Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.35,0:00:03.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.79,0:00:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们转化了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They turned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,恨死那些尖牙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hate those fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.67,0:00:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,她 她咬了我的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She … she bit me in the neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬一下倒没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bite doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有喝下血液 才会变成吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to actually ingest the blood to be infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.79,0:00:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他给你喝的是吸血鬼的血 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was vampire blood he dosed you with. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.98,0:00:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,会怕光 阳光会灼伤皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights are too bright? Sunshine hurt your skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得好饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你都在干些什么 - 猎魔 跟别人一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What have you been doing? - Hunting … with some other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.17,0:00:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 竟然跟陌生人共事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You? Working with strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们更像是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.84,0:00:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有空我教你 这可是你老爸梦寐以求的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick around, I'll show you tricks your daddy never even dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 只是无法抛下你和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't just lose you and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和本会呆在这儿 只要可以你随时都能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and ben will be here, and…You come when you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.18,0:00:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我完好无损地回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just come in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.46,0:00:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.45,0:00:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有好几次 你让我觉得很纳闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause there's been a few times that you've got me wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨姆 鲍比 他有点儿不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam, Bobby. He's just … he's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我觉得有点儿不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's not right to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.23,0:00:51.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.04,0:01:07.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1989年9月9日出生 艾米莉·方 林肯大街315号 灰岩镇 伊利诺州）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.41,0:01:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You came.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应过你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.92,0:01:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个地方坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.27,0:02:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太尴尬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你说什么都不会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing you could ever say would…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.42,0:02:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你发表的那些诗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, those poems you posted?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是你最真自我的体现\N{\fnArial\fs30}They revealed who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你 克里斯滕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you, Kristen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.41,0:02:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天又写了一首 你想不想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}wrote one today. You want to…?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.34,0:02:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十分乐意拜读\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗷 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.25,0:02:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,被纸划伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paper cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是个笨手笨脚的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, clumsiest person ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.41,0:03:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.11,0:03:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我脑海里挥之不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop thinking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一直想着我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.23,0:03:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.73,0:03:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没法厮守的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一定有其他办法的 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There has to be a way. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.71,0:03:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you know me…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实不然\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直作恶多端\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done bad things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.97,0:03:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该逃得远远地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.13,0:04:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以自己拿主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make my own decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.14,0:04:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经十七岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.97,0:04:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得让你看样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.81,0:04:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你害怕吗 - 不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you scared? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该害怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just scared…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是在做梦 等我醒来发现是在上数学课\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dreaming and I'll wake up in math class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很痛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it gonna hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.85,0:04:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:04:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.89,0:05:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你去看看我的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.70,0:05:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你住的地方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, your place…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是有 丝绒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}is there gonna be… velvet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.69,0:05:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.53,0:05:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 味道好难闻啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… It smells like pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 小罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Robbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯特 怎么回事儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robert, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.31,0:05:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不正是你想要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you wanted, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我就快到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, I'm actually not far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概再开一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about a night's drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那么你是想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? So, you think…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:05:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 不过得先办妥这儿的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's some stuff I got to do here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.78,0:06:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我在想 这边办妥之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was thinking that, uh, I'll wrap up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.67,0:06:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 要确保没被跟踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, you know, make sure I'm not followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得绕着僻路走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to take side streets,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且只能深夜回去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd have to come at night …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不可以给我闭上嘴 乖乖滚回来就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you just shut up and get your ass home?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迫不及待想见你 只能通电话实在很烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to see you. This phone thing's getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到时就打给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, call us when you're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.24,0:06:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有小心点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.05,0:06:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事让你这么荡漾\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you so stoked about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.76,0:06:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥 没什么 有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Nothing. What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,七天里有六个姑娘失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six girls in seven days,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过了这个镇一年的失踪人口数了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is more disappearances than this city has seen in over a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.15,0:06:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且都是同龄人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All about the same age.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且全都很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.11,0:06:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 这世界可是五光十色的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, ice cream comes in lots of flavors, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,6个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, half a dozen girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.63,0:06:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,十七八岁 接近成年\N{\fnArial\fs30}late teens, a shower away from greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.09,0:06:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去受害者都很相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.83,0:06:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好奇她们还有什么共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder what else they got in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有6个切入点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, six directions to go, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,选一个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,7 今天又增加了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven. Another call just came in today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯滕是个好孩子 的确有点幼稚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen's a good kid … a little naive, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.02,0:07:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量做一个好爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try and be a good parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩子真让人头疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls are hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,额 我们只想找到你女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Well, we'd just like to find your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.57,0:07:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边最后一间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last door on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.91,0:07:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他在说什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think he was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗑药吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,比嗑药可严重多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it is so much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些不是吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}These aren't vampires, man. These …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.08,0:07:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}these are douchebags.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.24,0:07:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有什么线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 让人太不舒服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That … that's just… uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.11,0:08:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他装什么忧郁王子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he so bummed out about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.44,0:08:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷看人家女孩睡觉 不是变态是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's watching her sleep. How is that not rapey?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我需要全神贯注\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to concentrate here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.80,0:08:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他能听见鲜血在她体内流淌」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He could hear the blood rushing inside her,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.70,0:08:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,「舌头似乎尝到了那绝妙的味道」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"almost taste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.39,0:08:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他拼命地想控制自己」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He tried desperately to control himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,「罗梅罗知道他们相爱无果」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romero knew their love was impossible."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗梅罗 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romero? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还是全国畅销书\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a national bestseller.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.73,0:08:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:01.53,Title,0,0,0,0,,试试「洛特纳」（《暮光之城》中饰演狼人雅各布·布莱克）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, try, um… "Lautner".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.77,0:09:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 他是狼人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. He's a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.45,0:09:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说你怎么知道他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you even know who that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.93,0:09:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞笑呢啊 那娃无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you kidding me? That kid's everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就是噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a freaking nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.55,0:09:14.75,Title,0,0,0,0,,帕丁森（《暮光之城》男主角）的名字里有多少个「T」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how many t's are there in Pattin…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,正解 密码破解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. We're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.88,0:09:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.03,0:09:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的收件箱全是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, her in-box is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,自称是吸血鬼的家伙的来信\N{\fnArial\fs30}from some guy claiming to be a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.61,0:09:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真正的吸血鬼 - 这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A real vampire? - Well, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.57,0:09:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我只能在晚上和你见面」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I can only meet you at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.07,0:09:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,「 我不太放心自己和你在一起 」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I don't trust myself with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.91,0:09:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我无法抵抗你鲜血的诱惑」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The call of your blood is too strong."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼网钓猎物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampires phishing for victims?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有可能是一个闲的蛋疼的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just a human mouth-breather, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,换句话说 这样捕猎多方便啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand, talk about easy prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.92,0:09:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于真正的吸血鬼来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}For actual vamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这些女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I mean, these chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己投怀送抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}are just throwing themselves at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you got to do is…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,写点蹩脚的诗 她们就上钩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Write bad poetry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人想和她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this guy wanted to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.23,0:09:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个叫「黑玫瑰」的地方见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a place called the Black Rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不嘞个是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:09:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是照着读出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just reporting the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.85,0:10:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能就是个变态 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably just your standard-issue perv, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.98,0:10:47.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（献血光荣）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定是吸血鬼干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, so you're sure it's vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.91,0:10:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 百分之百吗 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 100%? - Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,典型吸血鬼行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a pattern now …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:11:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,受害人失踪 捐血车被洗劫一空\N{\fnArial\fs30}kids go missing, blood-bank van gets jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是第四个镇子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the fourth town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,确凿的证据就是最近那个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clincher is, this last hit …
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,司机被发现时 喉咙被撕裂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}driver was found, throat ripped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抓孩子 来吸血 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, they grab kids … that's food, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.77,0:11:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 如果他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if they already got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.01,0:11:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有了新鲜的血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}a bunch of walking, talking juice bars,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.67,0:11:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛还要抢劫捐血车\N{\fnArial\fs30}why bother with the blood mobile?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.57,0:11:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他们的老巢 去找答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the nest. Figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.53,0:11:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要摇滚妞儿的话 这儿一大片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you wanted emo chicks. I think we hit ground zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在沙滩上也穿成那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think she wears all that rubber at the beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上次在一起喝酒是什么时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time we had a beer together, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.81,0:11:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很努力在泡那女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hitting on her hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是吸血鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 很难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, it's hard to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,又多一组嫌疑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we got multiple choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下可好 他们三个人 我们两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Three of them, two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.24,0:12:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 三人组变两人组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, make that two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.14,0:12:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个已经动身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你跟那个80后 我跟那个90后\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you go with Efron. I got Bieber.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好加入我的永恒国度了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready to join me in eternity?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,求之不得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干什么啊 - 张开嘴巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are you doing?! - Open your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.15,0:13:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那东西拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take those out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.53,0:13:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take 'em out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.46,0:13:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心 都多大了还玩这套\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of… What are you, 12?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:13:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是还擦闪粉了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you wearing glitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.13,0:14:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是想把个妹玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only do it to get laid, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意儿有用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我嘞个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 回去打你的炮吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, "Mmmbop" your way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.19,0:14:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啊 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.99,0:14:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得带套\N{\fnArial\fs30}And use a condom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个尤物啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.99,0:14:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.01,0:14:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个尤物\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You're pretty."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.26,0:14:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 真是抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sorry again, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥是直男\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't play for your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.21,0:15:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.11,0:15:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.77,0:16:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的亲娘 什么鬼声音啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god, what is that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪有什么声音 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sound, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.27,0:16:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞毛啊 小声点 擦的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on! Keep it down, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托把灯关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please shut that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.99,0:16:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.50,0:16:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你快坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you should sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.24,0:16:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我设想过千万种死法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of all the ways to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯独没料到会落入这般田地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought I'd be going out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, nobody is going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.03,0:16:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨穆埃尔一来 我就必死无疑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel's gonna kill me when he gets here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 迪恩 他不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.05,0:16:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会的 因为我会要他杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he is, 'cause I'm gonna ask him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.21,0:16:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你下不了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 先等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等什么 看我现在人模鬼样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what, huh?! Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.01,0:16:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会想出办法的 - 什么办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can figure this out! - How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.01,0:17:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么一点都不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't you freaked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.35,0:17:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我吓坏了 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course I am! - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.39,0:17:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的心跳我可是听得一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I can hear your heartbeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.67,0:17:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳得令人发指\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's pretty damn steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为我 我在努力使自己保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 'cause I'm … I'm trying to remain calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 听着 萨穆埃尔知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, Samuel will know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别做梦了 我现在就是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. I'm a monster, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况远没你想得那么轻巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a problem that you spitball.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得在我伤害别人之前做个了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to deal with this before I hurt somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.93,0:17:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.52,0:17:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.99,0:17:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个时候你跟我谈感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you want to talk about my feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说生理上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean physically.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,能有什么感觉 糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think it feels? Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.79,0:17:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,厕所 行不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bathroom, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.12,0:17:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,简讯简讯 大法师 吸血鬼想嘘嘘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}News flash, Mr. Wizard … vampires pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.08,0:18:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.89,0:18:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.59,0:18:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.94,0:19:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.25,0:19:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你还得再等几天才回来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't expecting you for a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.44,0:19:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.55,0:19:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.24,0:19:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我说 - 究竟怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen. - What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.18,0:19:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.45,0:19:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need you to know …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.13,0:19:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.93,0:19:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你吓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.84,0:19:48.13,Title,0,0,0,0,,老天 我成了帕丁森（《暮光之城》男主角爱德华扮演者）了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god, I'm Pattinson.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.70,0:19:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.17,0:19:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我 我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I-I-I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.84,0:19:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许走 你不能露个脸就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, you can't just show up here like this and then …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.77,0:19:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 相信我 我也情非得已 - 住嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Believe me, I wish it was different. - Just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.83,0:19:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把话说清楚 到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And explain to me what's going on out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.17,0:20:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莎 这简直一团糟 我不能把你扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lis, I can't bring this crap home to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是指你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,阴暗恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.61,0:20:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,血风腥雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.93,0:20:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna die. Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.27,0:20:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快告诉我你究竟怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me what the hell is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.25,0:20:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.63,0:20:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:20:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, just stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想听到你说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I heard you …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连你哥都看不住么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't keep track of your brother now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他不会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…I mean, I didn't think he'd just …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.21,0:21:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not himself, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在就是头饥饿难耐的怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a monster, and he's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.20,0:21:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得准备一下 把这事儿做个了断\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to prepare to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说他一来就会把我给灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you he'd kill me when he showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吸血了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you feed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去和莉莎道别来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to say goodbye to Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实证明 还真是个烂主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which, for the record, is a lousy idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.30,0:21:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我没喝任何人的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can relax. I didn't drink anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.80,0:21:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我快忍不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I came close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.12,0:22:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.49,0:22:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你执意要死也可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.12,0:22:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者让我把你变回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I can just turn you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.24,0:22:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.85,0:22:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大老远开车过来不是要杀你的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't drive all this way to kill you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.66,0:22:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.28,0:22:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我爷爷的手记\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my grandfather's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.20,0:22:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,解药是坎贝尔家的秘方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cure's an old Campbell recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.90,0:22:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像汤剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like the soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.40,0:22:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没人试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's tried it since god knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.52,0:23:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我所知 这玩意是段恶性迷幻旅程\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I hear, the stuff is a bad trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.10,0:23:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.27,0:23:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,解药本身没问题 但关键在你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, the cure is good. But a lot of this is on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.91,0:23:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要碰了人血就没救了 解药不会起作用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drink, you're done. It won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.66,0:23:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕只是一小滴人血都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking one drop of human blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.61,0:23:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白了 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. - Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.66,0:23:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终究会嗜血的 只是时间早晚而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you will feed. It's a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.25,0:23:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else do we need?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.98,0:23:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的已经有了 有的还要准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some stuff we got, some we got to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.68,0:23:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,最关键之处在于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trickiest thing on the list …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.08,0:23:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你变成吸血鬼的那家伙的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}blood of the Fang who turned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.10,0:23:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可不好对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy was huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.44,0:23:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这药方上没一样东西是容易应付的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing in the recipe about easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.15,0:23:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算直接闯进他们的老巢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna walk right into the nest?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.78,0:23:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我跟他们一样了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm one of them, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.91,0:23:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要大步往里走\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all I got to do is get in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.02,0:23:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁他孤立无援时\N{\fnArial\fs30}get the guy alone, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他多来点死人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}shoot him with so much dead man's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.05,0:23:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就能体会什么叫兄弟之情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll think he's rushing a fraternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.54,0:23:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.29,0:23:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 兄弟你气味太明显了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Dude, you reek.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.25,0:23:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就跟个人肉大汉堡似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like a walking hamburger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.00,0:23:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to do this solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.75,0:23:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们还不知道他老巢在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except we haven't been able to find him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.78,0:23:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是问题 我能闻到他们的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem. I can smell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.47,0:23:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在镇上往东两英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're two miles east of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.79,0:23:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们带上其他材料在那里跟我汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys get the other crap and meet me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.63,0:23:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.00,0:24:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是死人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dead man's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.75,0:24:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够你对付两三个小喽罗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there's enough there to drop a linebacker and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.13,0:24:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.20,0:24:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你咋回事 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's wrong with you, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.77,0:24:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.59,0:24:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明明知道解药的事 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You knew about the cure. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.63,0:24:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我咋可能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.60,0:24:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们几个月前谈论过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought we talked about it, months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.05,0:24:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是跟我吧 可能是克里斯蒂娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me. It must have been Christian or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.68,0:24:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.88,0:24:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪事了 如果你事先就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's strange, 'cause if you had known,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.53,0:24:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就像是你故意让他变成吸血鬼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd be almost like you let him get turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.08,0:24:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想找人打入内部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a man on the inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.39,0:24:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好帮我们找到吸血鬼始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}help us find that alpha vamp we've been looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.05,0:25:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.83,0:25:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会让我亲哥哥这样冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'd do something like that, risk my own brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.50,0:25:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才咋回事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.43,0:25:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我只是很庆幸我们能治好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm just relieved we can fix him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.34,0:26:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.59,0:26:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Uh, I'm …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.39,0:26:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯里斯在酒吧外转变的那家伙是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy Boris turned outside the bar, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.67,0:26:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他交代要好好关照你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said to look out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.05,0:26:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.32,0:26:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你成功了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, glad you made it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.23,0:26:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.63,0:26:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定饿坏了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you must be starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.77,0:27:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这包了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.71,0:27:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.21,0:27:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来的路上干掉了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed so many people on the way over here, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.92,0:27:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.45,0:27:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,组织上的规定 我们不能再无故杀人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Company line is we don't just kill people anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.36,0:27:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你一定得告诉我那感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got to tell me what that's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.86,0:27:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.04,0:27:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一有机会 我就表演给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, first chance I get, I'll … I'll show you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.14,0:27:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言为定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.80,0:27:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.35,0:27:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是在嫉妒\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.82,0:27:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,招募者能和小妞们嘿咻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The recruiters get to bang all the chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.12,0:27:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次就是你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's you now, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.00,0:28:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 招募者 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Recruiters? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.17,0:28:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大会跟你解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big man will explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.21,0:28:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be with you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.44,0:28:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的肌肤有如夜晚的天鹅绒\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Your skin is the black velvet of the night."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.84,0:28:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 那小妞肯定吃这套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice. That stupid bitch will eat that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.12,0:28:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴不得赶紧跟我们见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be dying to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.99,0:28:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己去喝点血 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get yourself some blood, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.86,0:28:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后带上你的小屁股回来 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then march that little ass right back here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.01,0:28:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.51,0:28:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为那猎人把你脑袋砍下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the hunter chopped your pretty head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.52,0:28:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 我跑得快\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.28,0:28:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 什么猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, what's a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.47,0:29:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他找到我们 你就明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see, if he finds us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.45,0:29:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着看他被剖膛开肚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see him inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.84,0:29:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝过血了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You eaten?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.61,0:29:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.16,0:29:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.97,0:29:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,会派上用场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.67,0:29:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啥用\N{\fnArial\fs30}For?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯特没告诉你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robert didn't tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.45,0:29:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我多大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.74,0:29:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, 33?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.68,0:29:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,差太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.03,0:29:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经六百多岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By about…six centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.03,0:29:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了六百年吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these are the best days in the last 600 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.22,0:29:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是最好的年代\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.18,0:29:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么德古拉 什么安妮·赖斯 都是浮云\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dracula, Anne Rice? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.49,0:29:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这帮小屁孩饥渴得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}These stupid little brats are so horny,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.05,0:29:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她们眼里 咱就是开着跑车的王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}they reinvented us as prince charming with a Volvo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.95,0:29:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们想要吸血尖牙作为定情信物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want a promise ring with fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.63,0:30:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就满足了她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I give it to 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.20,0:30:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出去钓几个漂亮妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You … you go out, you get them,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.61,0:30:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给我带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you bring 'em home to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.90,0:30:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要关在笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's with the cages?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.67,0:30:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在她们乖乖听话前的约束而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's just, you know, till they're compliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.80,0:30:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终这些妞也要出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eventually, these girls will go out,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.21,0:30:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,钓一些你这样的帅哥回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they'll fetch me boys like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.04,0:30:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样不断发展壮大\N{\fnArial\fs30}And around and around we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.25,0:30:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不说 相当完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to say, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.48,0:30:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这整个系统 都是你建立的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole system, that's … that's all you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.01,0:30:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.96,0:30:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个执行者 明白不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just implement, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.47,0:30:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保你们自觉行事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure that you all fall in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.23,0:30:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.37,0:30:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们父亲建立的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father's.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.09,0:30:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Your father's?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.51,0:30:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好奇心还真重啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you the curious one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.72,0:30:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你想象得还要好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you don't know the half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.79,0:30:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等时机成熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}In due time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.47,0:31:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.28,0:31:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不想和我共游一回\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the private tour, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.71,0:31:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我情何以堪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you'd never ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.17,0:31:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,想耍我吗 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You playing games with me, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.98,0:31:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.07,0:33:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.87,0:34:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该就是这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must be the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.04,0:34:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这卧底动静也太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for undercover.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.55,0:34:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.21,0:35:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该知道 你阻止不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've stopped nothing. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.26,0:35:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可比你我强大得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is much bigger than you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.54,0:36:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥果然还是坎贝尔家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like your brother has some Campbell in him after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.71,0:36:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.80,0:36:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.99,0:37:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有效 过程可不会很轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this works, it's not gonna be a kiddie ride. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.98,0:37:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,正合我意 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. Light her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.48,0:37:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在里面发现什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what did you see in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.86,0:37:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 吸血鬼老巢有发现什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - In the nest. What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.82,0:37:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我听不清你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.79,0:37:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你血流的声音太他妈震耳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your…your blood is so freaking loud, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.68,0:37:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…just back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.89,0:37:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把解药给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the damn cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.39,0:37:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,活着万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}L'chaim.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.72,0:37:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.57,0:38:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it working?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.97,0:38:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不成功就要成仁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either that or he's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.94,0:39:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,早啊 昨天发现什么没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. So, what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.75,0:39:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.35,0:39:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吸血鬼老巢 你发现什么没\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the nest. What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.14,0:39:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在努力回想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, well, I'm still trying to work through it,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.43,0:39:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但肯定的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, I'm pretty sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.33,0:39:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是独立组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're not figuring out anything on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.93,0:39:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有接受上头的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting their orders from the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.29,0:39:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,该做什么怎么做之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where to go next, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.24,0:39:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的上头是指\N{\fnArial\fs30}The top as in…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.74,0:39:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.70,0:39:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我是这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, that's what I think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.10,0:39:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们之间有心灵感应\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got some sort of psychic thing happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.08,0:39:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,传达着某种指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he sends them, uh … I don't know … messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.07,0:39:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.30,0:40:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,实话实说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.99,0:40:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,招募新人变成吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recruitment drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.12,0:40:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的始祖在组建吸血鬼大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their Alpha's building an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.47,0:40:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太让人「振奋」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.95,0:40:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不是最糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.96,0:40:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么更糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what is?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.79,0:40:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不再畏惧我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't scare them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.97,0:40:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've reached Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.09,0:40:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请留言 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me a message. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.99,0:40:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lis.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.65,0:40:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续留言 请按键1\N{\fnArial\fs30}To continue recording, press 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.33,0:40:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,删除请按\N{\fnArial\fs30}To erase …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.28,0:40:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟莉莎聊得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did it go with Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.75,0:40:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没打通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.36,0:40:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.41,0:40:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.91,0:40:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.72,0:40:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.20,0:40:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么 我都可以指望你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what happens, I can always count on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.08,0:40:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}rght, sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.43,0:41:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Of course, Dean.
